	url = {https://zenodo.org/record/6023735},
	abstract = {There is a new rgbif maintainer: John Waller. NEW FEATURES {\textless}code{\textgreater}derived\_dataset(){\textless}/code{\textgreater} : New function to register a cleaned or modified dataset on GBIF for citation. (\#467) {\textless}code{\textgreater}name\_backbone\_checklist(){\textless}/code{\textgreater} : New function that takes a list, vector, or data.frame of scientific names and asynchronously matches them to the backbone. (\#475) {\textless}code{\textgreater}pred\_isnull(){\textless}/code{\textgreater} : New predicate function that includes NULL values from a column in the download. (\#489) {\textless}code{\textgreater}occ\_download.print(){\textless}/code{\textgreater} : Now prints out much more information including a DOI and citation. (\#494) DEPRECATED {\textless}code{\textgreater}gbif\_citation.gbif(){\textless}/code{\textgreater} : it is no longer considered best practice to generate a citation from {\textless}code{\textgreater}occ\_search(){\textless}/code{\textgreater} or {\textless}code{\textgreater}occ\_data(){\textless}/code{\textgreater}. We recommend {\textless}code{\textgreater}occ\_download(){\textless}/code{\textgreater} or {\textless}code{\textgreater}derived\_dataset(){\textless}/code{\textgreater} instead. (\#494) MINOR IMPROVEMENTS {\textless}code{\textgreater}occ\_download\_wait(){\textless}/code{\textgreater} and {\textless}code{\textgreater}occ\_download\_meta(){\textless}/code{\textgreater} : now accept a class character download key directly. The keys does do not need to be class "occ\_download". (\#487) {\textless}code{\textgreater}name\_backbone(){\textless}/code{\textgreater} : now returns new columns "verbatim\_name", "verabtim\_genus" ect. that the user has supplied. This makes it easier for the user to track what has been matched. The verbose argument also has been un-retired. If {\textless}code{\textgreater}verbose=TRUE{\textless}/code{\textgreater}, more results will be returned in a single data.frame. (\#475) 